{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HCNLwhnpq9tcikkhK4d1zH","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# importance_margin_vla_compress — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-25 05:45 UTC | 更新原因: 修正 ETA（Long ~21:00 UTC），westd-41074 仍空闲 Agent 正在部署，记录错误模型问题 M105\\\\n\\\\n> 详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nVLA vision token compressibility: **scoring method × connector × task 三维交互**。5+ 模型 × 4 LIBERO suites。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n🚨 **westd-41074**: 4 GPU 空闲，Agent 正在部署 OpenVLA Random k=0.9 Goal + Spatial（crossover 表唯一缺失）。⚠️ 之前部署使用了错误模型（M105），必须用 suite 对应微调模型。\\\\n🏃 **westd-38929**: 4 个 OpenVLA Long v3 实验 RUNNING（12:49 UTC 启动，Task 1/10）。**真实 ETA ~21:00 UTC**（非之前估的 13:00）。初步数据：Attn=50%, Random=64%, L2norm=72%。\\\\n🏃 **cqa1-33015**: 4 个 π0.5 cliff batch 在 torch.compile 阶段（正常）。\\\\n🏃 **westd-27271**: GPU 0 baseline Object s42 Task 7/10 (~2h)；GPU 1 Random Object s42 Task 4/10 (~3h)。\\\\n\\\\n## Deadlines\\\\n- **CoRL 2026 Abstract**: May 26 (~10h)\\\\n- **CoRL 2026 Paper**: May 29 (4 days)\\\\n\\\\n## OpenVLA (MLP) k=0.9 Crossover Table\\\\n| Suite | Baseline | Attn | L2norm | Random | Best |\\\\n|-------|----------|------|--------|--------|------|\\\\n| Object | 74.0% (s7⚠️) | 61.4% (-12.6pp) | 70.6% (-3.4pp) | 64.6% (-9.4pp)⚠️ | **L2norm** |\\\\n| Goal | 74.8% | 73.2% (-1.6pp) | **74.8%** (0pp) ✅ | 🚨 westd-41074 部署中 ~5h | **L2norm** |\\\\n| Spatial | 80.0% | **80.4%** (+0.4pp) ✅ | 75.0% (-5pp) | 🚨 westd-41074 部署中 ~5h | **Attn** |\\\\n| Long | 52.8% | 🏃 ~21:00 UTC (T1=50%) | 🏃 ~21:00 UTC (T1=72%) | 🏃 ~21:00 UTC (T1=64%) | TBD |\\\\n\\\\n### 2×2 Crossover\\\\n| | Attention | L2 norm |\\\\n|---|---------|---------|\\\\n| **Entangling (X-VLA)** | ✅ Long +60pp | ❌ aggressive k: -28pp |\\\\n| **MLP (OpenVLA)** | Spatial ✅ lossless; Goal -1.6pp; Object ❌ -12.6pp | Goal ✅ 无损; Object ✅ +6pp vs Rnd; Spatial ❌ -5pp |\\\\n| **Linear (π0.5)** | ❌ neutral/-30pp | ✅✅ +46pp cliff |\\\\n\\\\n**OpenVLA pattern: task-dependent** — Object/Goal 偏好 L2norm，Spatial 偏好 Attention。\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 🚨 westd-41074 部署 Random k=0.9 Goal + Spatial（用正确模型！）\\\\n- [ ] 🟡 westd-41074 GPU 2-3 部署 pending 实验\\\\n- [ ] westd-38929 Long v3 等结果 (~21:00 UTC)\\\\n- [ ] cqa1 π0.5 cliff batch 等结果\\\\n- [ ] westd-27271 baseline/Random Object 等结果 (~2-3h)\\\\n- [ ] Abstract finalization（待 Random Goal/Spatial + Long 数据）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU (14 张)\\\\n| 服务器 | GPU 0 | GPU 1 | GPU 2 | GPU 3 |\\\\n|--------|-------|-------|-------|-------|\\\\n| westd-38929 | OV Attn k0.9 Long 🏃 | OV Attn k0.85 Long 🏃 | OV Rnd k0.9 Long 🏃 | OV L2n k0.9 Long 🏃 |\\\\n| westd-27271 | OV baseline Obj s42 🏃 | OV Rnd Obj s42 🏃(未注册) | — | — |\\\\n| cqa1-33015 | π0.5 Rnd k085 Goal 🏃 | π0.5 L2n k085 Obj 🏃 | π0.5 Rnd k085 Long 🏃 | π0.5 L2n k085 Long 🏃 |\\\\n| westd-41074 | 🚨 部署中 Rnd Goal | 🚨 部署中 Rnd Spat | ⏳ 待定 | ⏳ 待定 |\\\\n\\\\n## 时间线（修正后）\\\\n- Now: Agent 部署 westd-41074（Random Goal + Spatial，~5h）\\\\n- +2h: westd-27271 baseline Object 完成\\\\n- +5h (~18:30 UTC): Random Goal/Spatial 完成 → crossover 表 3/4 行完整\\\\n- +8h (~21:00 UTC): westd-38929 Long 完成 → crossover 表 4/4 行完整\\\\n- Day 2 (5/26): Abstract 定稿\\\\n- Day 3-4 (5/27-29): Paper polish + submission\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D210 | 2026-05-25 | OpenVLA Attn k=0.9: Goal/Spatial 几乎无损 (-1.6pp/+0.4 | eval_openvla_attn_k09_object_seed42_v3, eval_openvla_attn_k09_goal_seed42, eval_openvla_attn_k09_spatial_seed42 |\\\\n| D209 | 2026-05-24 | 放弃 SimplerEnv benchmark，集中 LIBERO + MetaWorld。Open | simplerenv_bridge_baseline |\\\\n| D208 | 2026-05-24 | MetaWorld SmolVLA sweep 完成：L2norm k=0.90 有微弱正 marg | eval_smolvla_metaworld_random_sweep, eval_smolvla_metaworld_l2norm_sweep |\\\\n| D207 | 2026-05-24 | SimplerEnv 用 ManiSkill3 的 4 个 Bridge tasks（PutCarr | simplerenv_bridge_baseline |\\\\n| D206 | 2026-05-24 | D206: Importance margin is k-dependent — only stro | eval_pi05_l2norm_k09_long_seed42_postfix_v2, eval_pi05_l2norm_k07_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_l2norm_k05_long_seed42_postfix |\\\\n| D205 | 2026-05-24 | Spatial Random k=0.3 postfix = 43.4%. 全 4 suite ×  | eval_pi05_random_k03_spatial_seed42_postfix_v2 |\\\\n| D204 | 2026-05-24 | Long Random disruption curve complete (6/6). k=0.3 | eval_pi05_random_k09_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k03_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k095_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k085_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k07_long_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k05_long_seed42_postfix |\\\\n| D203 | 2026-05-24 | D203: L2norm k=0.95 Goal = 90.8%，低于 baseline (96.4 | eval_pi05_l2norm_k095_goal_seed42_postfix |\\\\n| D202 | 2026-05-24 | D202: Disruption peak 位置非固定——Spatial peak 在 k=0.90 | eval_pi05_random_k09_spatial_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k085_spatial_seed42_postfix_v2 |\\\\n| D201 | 2026-05-24 | D201: Goal Random post-fix curve complete (6/6) —  | eval_pi05_random_k095_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k09_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k085_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k07_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k05_goal_seed42_postfix, eval_pi05_random_k03_goal_seed42_postfix |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4707, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LUSxDsPyqr6gx8jzrpSmku","session_id":"47b17614-1ae9-46bc-87bd-87205f677c45","uuid":"105d7169-9ddf-4678-8d13-a3e94ffdc7c2","timestamp":"2026-05-25T06:20:09.191Z"}
